{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">元朗一個傢俬貨倉起火，無人受傷。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">起火的貨倉冒出濃煙，消防員到場撲救。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.FIRE.YL-2130_002.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/20265cOlvIrKnU1785075566.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.FIRE.YL-2130_002.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">事發在下午5時許，警方接報元朗白沙山路一個傢俬貨倉起火，火場面積30米乘30面米，消防出動2煙帽隊及2條喉灌救，約1.5小時後救熄，期間三人自行疏散，無人被困或受傷，消防正調查起火原因。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.FIRE.YL-2130_001.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/2026TEPlCAlgHZ1785075582.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.FIRE.YL-2130_001.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-26T14:38:25.073841+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":129,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}